{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 tabby cats in every city. Keep your eyes open.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/extras/CoverTemp.png?t=1747972523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stray Tekirs</i> is a relaxing hidden object game where you try to find cleverly hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> in stylized city silhouettes. The scenes are filled with abstract shapes and layered structures \u2014 sometimes just the curve of a tail or the tip of an ear gives them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Stylized urban silhouettes inspired by real cities<br>\ud83d\udc3e 100 hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> per map<br>\u23f1\ufe0f Play with a timer or explore freely<br>\ud83c\udfa7 A simple, calm, relaxing \u2014 and sometimes challenging \u2014 experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay focused \u2014 some of these tabbies are very well hidden.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740890?t=1747972523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/f9f4b222eb15701f076970332fd2b9660b8bb522/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747972523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/6df23f984feea29424bf3a995a57cb4ecc211bdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747972523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/6df23f984feea29424bf3a995a57cb4ecc211bdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747972523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Some map visuals in the game were initially generated using AI tools for concept inspiration. These were then extensively edited and manually redrawn to match the game\u2019s unique silhouette-based art style. No AI is used during gameplay or in any real-time game systems.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 tabby cats in every city. Keep your eyes open.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/extras/CoverTemp.png?t=1747972523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stray Tekirs</i> is a relaxing hidden object game where you try to find cleverly hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> in stylized city silhouettes. The scenes are filled with abstract shapes and layered structures \u2014 sometimes just the curve of a tail or the tip of an ear gives them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Stylized urban silhouettes inspired by real cities<br>\ud83d\udc3e 100 hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> per map<br>\u23f1\ufe0f Play with a timer or explore freely<br>\ud83c\udfa7 A simple, calm, relaxing \u2014 and sometimes challenging \u2014 experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay focused \u2014 some of these tabbies are very well hidden.</p>","developers":["VIBRA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/75758157ed3fe33499f501807438191cde2339c8/header.jpg?t=1747972523","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139197,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139197/movie480.mp4?t=1747406688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139197/movie_max.mp4?t=1747406688"},"name":"Stray Tekirs First Look","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139197/ae7ded0e9ce0adc4dfc5dfe1dea49b5342b15dba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747406688"